   "text": "ONE 512 KBPS LINE. SIX PCS.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 46
  },
  {
   "text": "In this game you share one\nfive hundred and twelve\nkilobit line between a\nwhole shop of customers.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 5.74,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "On that line, this demo\nwould take about sixteen\nminutes to download.",
   "start": 5.99,
   "duration": 4.016,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Brazilian LAN House 2003.\nSix beige PCs, a foosball\ntable, and a neighbourhood\nthat wants to play.",
   "start": 12.256,
   "duration": 7.36,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "You run the tabs, the\npower and the machines,\nand when a PC freezes, you\nfix it from the network\nmonitor.",
   "start": 19.866,
   "duration": 6.289,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
